---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout lang="en" title="About Us">
  <article class="container-prose py-16">
    <header class="mb-12 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="display mb-4">About Axomiya IT Labs</h1>
      <p class="lead">Rooted in Assam — building the future of AI and open-source for everyone.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="content-prose mx-auto">
      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>The internet is the greatest free encyclopedia humanity has ever built. We are here to collect precise information, make thoughtful analyses, present clear findings, add local context, and make all of it accessible to everyone in Assam — so that no one is left behind by international standards of technology and knowledge.</p>
      <p>If you want to share what you know, benefit others, and explore new fields with genuine curiosity — this is your community. Whatever you do professionally, bring your best.</p>
      <blockquote><p>Assam's first AI and open-source space, where everyone is welcome.</p></blockquote>
      <h2>What We Do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Learn:</strong> We share short guides, tutorials, and plain-language explanations of AI and tech.</li>
        <li><strong>Build:</strong> We create real projects, AI tools, and platforms that solve local problems.</li>
        <li><strong>Share:</strong> We believe small help compounds. Every translation and bug report makes the community stronger.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>